## Setup

```bash
mise install                  # terraform + tflint + pre-commit, pinned
mise run setup:dev            # install git hooks
mise run check                # lint (fmt, validate, tflint) + terraform test
```

Common tasks: `mise run check:lint` · `mise run test:fast` · `mise run plan [dir]`.
With several root modules, `lint:terraform-validate` validates each one, and
`plan`/`apply` take the module's directory.

State and `*.tfvars` hold secrets and are gitignored — configure the backend and
provider for your environment.

